{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {},
    "%@ collections": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ collections"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ mods": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · Free account": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Compte gratuit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · Premium": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Premium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — %lld left": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ — %2$lld left"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — encore %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld mods": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld mods · %lld loaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$lld mods · %2$lld loaded"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld mods · %2$lld chargés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld new mods will be turned on when you quit the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld nouveaux mods seront activés quand vous quitterez le jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld requirement issues": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld problèmes de prérequis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld saves": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld sauvegardes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Always Loaded**: .pak files without a mod description. The game loads them whatever the load order says; move one to the Trash to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Toujours chargés** : des fichiers .pak sans description de mod. Le jeu les charge quoi que dise l’ordre de chargement ; placez-en un dans la corbeille pour l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Back Up All** (or right-click → **Back Up**) copies saves as .zip files to **Documents/Larian Studios/Tadpole Save Backups**. They're kept there until you delete them, even if you reinstall the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Tout sauvegarder** (ou clic droit → **Sauvegarder**) copie les sauvegardes en fichiers .zip dans **Documents/Larian Studios/Tadpole Save Backups**. Elles y restent jusqu’à ce que vous les supprimiez, même si vous réinstallez le jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Browse Nexus** (⌘2): search Baldur's Gate 3 mods and install them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Parcourir Nexus** (⌘2) : cherchez des mods de Baldur’s Gate 3 et installez-les."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Browse Nexus** searches Baldur's Gate 3 mods. Open one to see its files, then **Install**. **Open the Nexus Website** shows the full site in Tadpole's own browser, where your sign-in is remembered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Parcourir Nexus** cherche des mods de Baldur’s Gate 3. Ouvrez-en un pour voir ses fichiers, puis **Installer**. **Ouvrir le site de Nexus** affiche le site complet dans le navigateur de Tadpole, où votre connexion est mémorisée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Collections** (⌘3): curated mod packs from Nexus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Collections** (⌘3) : des ensembles de mods choisis, sur Nexus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Collections** lists curated mod packs. A collection shows which of its mods you already have; **Install** downloads the rest. Optional mods are only installed if you tick them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Collections** liste des ensembles de mods choisis. Une collection montre lesquels de ses mods vous avez déjà ; **Installer** télécharge le reste. Les mods optionnels ne sont installés que si vous les cochez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Listed, but its .pak isn't in the Mods folder**: a mod you removed by hand. **Remove** takes it out of the load order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Listé, mais son .pak n’est pas dans le dossier Mods** : un mod que vous avez supprimé à la main. **Retirer** l’enlève de l’ordre de chargement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Load Order** (⌘1): your mods, which ones load, and in what order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Ordre de chargement** (⌘1) : vos mods, lesquels sont chargés, et dans quel ordre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Play** in the toolbar (⌘L) starts the game through Steam. Quit the game before changing your mods: it rewrites its mod list when it quits, which would undo your changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Jouer** dans la barre d’outils (⌘L) lance le jeu par Steam. Quittez le jeu avant de changer vos mods : il réécrit sa liste de mods en quittant, ce qui annulerait vos changements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Restore** puts a backup back in the game. If that save still exists, Tadpole asks first, and the current version goes to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Restaurer** remet une copie dans le jeu. Si cette sauvegarde existe encore, Tadpole demande d’abord, et la version actuelle va dans la corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Saves** (⌘4): your saves, and backups of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Sauvegardes** (⌘4) : vos sauvegardes, et leurs copies."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Saves** lists your saves, newest first, with the game's picture, your party and the difficulty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Sauvegardes** liste vos parties, les plus récentes d’abord, avec l’image du jeu, votre groupe et la difficulté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 requirement issue": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 problème de prérequis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mod doesn't show up in the game": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un mod n’apparaît pas dans le jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clé d’API"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Tadpole": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
