          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Link to Another Nexus Mod…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lier à un autre mod Nexus…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linking a mod lets Tadpole show its Nexus page, its optional files and, later, its updates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lier un mod permet à Tadpole d’afficher sa page Nexus, ses fichiers optionnels et, plus tard, ses mises à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listed, but its .pak isn't in the Mods folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listé, mais son .pak n’est pas dans le dossier Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load More": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load Order": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordre de chargement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load Order, Browse Nexus, Collections, Saves": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordre de chargement, Parcourir Nexus, Collections, Sauvegardes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load order file": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichier d’ordre de chargement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loads after this mod: use Order by Requirements": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargé après ce mod : utilisez Trier selon les prérequis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a warning badge: a missing or late requirement can stop a mod from loading.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cherchez un badge d’avertissement : un prérequis manquant ou chargé trop tard peut empêcher un mod de se charger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Main Files": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichiers principaux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many Baldur's Gate 3 mods use Norbyte's **Script Extender**, which only exists for Windows. On a Mac, those mods install and load, but whatever they do through scripts doesn't happen: new spells may do nothing, menus may not appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beaucoup de mods de Baldur’s Gate 3 utilisent le **Script Extender** de Norbyte, qui n’existe que pour Windows. Sur Mac, ces mods s’installent et se chargent, mais ce qu’ils font par script n’a pas lieu : de nouveaux sorts peuvent ne rien faire, des menus peuvent ne pas apparaître."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Miscellaneous": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Divers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mod manager for Baldur's Gate 3 on macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestionnaire de mods pour Baldur’s Gate 3 sur macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mod name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nom du mod"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mod pages, files and collections come from Nexus Mods. Not affiliated with Larian Studios or Nexus Mods.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pages de mods, fichiers et collections viennent de Nexus Mods. Sans lien avec Larian Studios ni Nexus Mods."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mods (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods are waiting to be turned on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des mods attendent d’être activés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods can need other mods. A warning badge shows when a requirement is missing, turned off, or loads after the mod that needs it. **Order by Requirements** moves each requirement above the mods that need it, keeping the rest of your order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des mods peuvent avoir besoin d’autres mods. Un badge d’avertissement apparaît quand un prérequis manque, est désactivé, ou se charge après le mod qui en a besoin. **Trier selon les prérequis** place chaque prérequis au-dessus des mods qui en ont besoin, en gardant le reste de votre ordre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier Mods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods load from top to bottom; drag to reorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mods se chargent de haut en bas ; faites-les glisser pour changer l’ordre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mods made for an older version of the game can stop working after a game update. Check the mod's Nexus page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des mods faits pour une ancienne version du jeu peuvent cesser de marcher après une mise à jour du jeu. Vérifiez la page Nexus du mod."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Monk": {
