            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nexus ne permet le téléchargement direct qu’aux membres Premium. Utilisez plutôt « Mod Manager Download » sur le site."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus rate limit reached. Try again in a little while.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limite de requêtes Nexus atteinte. Réessayez dans un moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nexus request failed (HTTP %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La requête à Nexus a échoué (HTTP %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No .pak file in this download. Mods made of loose files or for the Script Extender can't be installed by Tadpole.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun fichier .pak dans ce téléchargement. Tadpole ne peut pas installer les mods faits de fichiers libres ni ceux pour le Script Extender."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No .pak file was found in: %@. Mods made of loose files or for the Script Extender can't be installed this way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
